###############################################################################
# "Library" OData V4 test model - service document & metadata
#
# Start the server first:  dotnet run --project src/LibraryService
# Every request carries the result actually observed against .NET 10.0 with
# Microsoft.AspNetCore.OData 9.5.0. See ../FEATURE-COVERAGE.md for the verdicts.
###############################################################################

@host = http://localhost:5091/odata/v4/library
# container image: http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/library

### 200 - 16 entries: 10 entity sets, the MainBranch singleton and 5 function
### imports (TotalMediaCount, AllLanguages, StatsPerBranch, MostReadMedium,
### NewReleases). Search and LoanStatistics are declared but not listed here.
GET {{host}}/

### 200 - the central comparison artifact. Diff against the reference EDMX,
### model/library.xml of odata2ts/test-reference-model. Four schemas survive -
### Library.Catalog, Library.Circulation, PublisherRegistry and the container.
###
### The seven annotations the reference model declares, and where they land:
###   Medium/PopularityScore  <Annotation Term="…Core.V1.Computed" Bool="true"/>
###   Loan/LoanedAt           <Annotation Term="…Core.V1.Immutable" Bool="true"/>
###   Member/ActiveSince      <Annotation Term="…Core.V1.ComputedDefaultValue" Bool="true"/>
###   Member/Balance          <Annotation Term="…Core.V1.Permissions">
###                             <EnumMember>…Core.V1.Permission/Read</EnumMember>
###   PrintMedium             …Core.V1.AlternateKeys (out of line, Record)
###   Container/Copies        …Core.V1.OptimisticConcurrency (PropertyPath Condition)
###   Container/Media         …Capabilities.V1.SearchRestrictions (Record)
### The EnumMember shape is this server's doing; the model builder emits a Record
### there, which the spec does not allow for an enum-typed term.
###
### 61 further annotations are this server's own addition and a deliberate
### deviation from the reference EDMX - descriptions, units, currencies, value
### constraints and the container's capabilities. They are in annotations.http,
### together with the request that verifies each one.
GET {{host}}/$metadata

### 404 - unknown entity set
GET {{host}}/Unknown
